{number: 82}
{title: Standing on the Promises}
{key: C}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[C] Standing on the promises of Christ my King,
Thro' eternal ages let His praises [G7] ring;
[C] Glory in the highest, I will shout and sing,
Standing on the [G7] promises of [C] God.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[C] Standing, [F] standing,
[G7] Standing on the promises of [C] God my Savior;
[C] Standing, [F] standing,
I'm [C] standing on the [G7] promises of [C] God.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[C] Standing on the promises that cannot fail,
When the howling storms of doubt and fear as-[G7] sail,
By the [C] living Word of God I shall prevail,
Standing on the [G7] promises of [C] God.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[C] Standing on the promises of Christ the Lord,
Bound to Him eternally by love's strong [G7] cord,
Over-[C] coming daily with the Spirit's sword,
Standing on the [G7] promises of [C] God.
{end_of_verse}
